  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Ciencia y Tecnologa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Science and Technology Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT CONSISTS OF FIVE COMPONENTS: I) GLOBAL INVESTMENT IN RESEARCH PROJECTS AND SERVICES; II) THE FINANCING OF INFRASTRUCTURE PROJECTS; III) A GLOBAL PROGRAM OF HUMAN RESOURCES TRAINING; IV) THE TRANSFER AND DIFFUSION OF TECHNOLOGY; AND V) THE INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING OF CONACYT. A REIMBURSABLE PROJECT PREPARATION FACILITY (PPF) OPERATION FOR US$945,100 IS UNDER STUDY TO PREPARE THE PROGRAM TO FINANCE INDIVIDUAL CONSULTING SERVICES.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
